    "In the factory mapping, the two side buttons are mouse buttons 4 / 5 (Back / Forward)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the factory mapping, the two side buttons are mouse buttons 4 / 5 (Back / Forward)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出厂映射中两个侧键是鼠标按钮 4 / 5（后退 / 前进）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出厂映射中两个侧键是鼠标按钮 4 / 5（后退 / 前进）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In this mode the firmware ignores the on-board button mapping (usually Synapse on Windows switched it). Mappings take effect after switching back to Normal mode." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In this mode the firmware ignores the on-board button mapping (usually Synapse on Windows switched it). Mappings take effect after switching back to Normal mode."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个模式下固件不执行板载按键映射（通常是被 Windows 上的 Synapse 切过去的）。切回 Normal 模式后映射才会生效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个模式下固件不执行板载按键映射（通常是被 Windows 上的 Synapse 切过去的）。切回 Normal 模式后映射才会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
